{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309680","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309680","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130968001:1":{"text":"네에?! 이렇게나 아름답고 날렵한 동물을 왜 보냐뇨?","source_cn":"听你这话说的！这么美丽又灵敏的动物，难道你就不喜欢吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47CE7E47948B3ADC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130968002:1":{"text":"솔직히 전 초코보가 이 크림슨 고원을 대표하는 동물이라고 생각해요. 누구든 초코보를 아껴줘야 한다고 봐요!","source_cn":"实话实说，我一直觉得它是最能代表深红高原的动物，每个人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DC6CAB27158112E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130968003:1":{"text":"저희 집이 세일린워터 마을만 아니었어도, 트라이브한테서 초코보 한 마리를 사서 길렀을 텐데.","source_cn":"要不是我住在咸水镇，没地养，我早就从蛮血手里买一只回去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EDBDA54DEBE04F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130968004:1":{"text":"…저 맞은편에 달리다 넘어지는 새끼 초코보를 좀 보세요! 정말 너무 귀엽지 않아요?","source_cn":"——你看对面那只小陆行鸟！跑着跑着就摔倒了，真可爱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x993A7AAA6929145F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:赏金猎人扬尼":{"text":"현상금 사냥꾼 요니","source":"赏金猎人扬尼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}